    "markdown": "---\ntitle: Viking Exhibition\ncompany: Getaway Room Escape\ndate: 10 May 2026 12:45\ncity: Hämeenlinna\ncountry: Finland\nlong: 24.45828558824754\nlat: 61.003311625868484\ncompletion-time: 60 min\nrating: 5\nclues: 3\n\nabout: \n  template: broadside\n  links: \n    - icon: globe2\n      href: https://www.getaway.fi/en/hameenlinna-en/escape-rooms/#viking-exhibition\n\nplayers:\n  - Hanno\n  - Fatima\n  \ncost: 90\ncurrency: EUR\npaid-by: Hanno\n\ntemplate-partials: \n  - title-block.html\n\nexecute: \n  echo: false\n  warning: false\n  error: false\n---\n\n::: {.callout-important icon=\"false\"}\n## Fatima's impressions\n\n- Varied puzzles, some based on locks, some based on physics\n- There is a lot to do in the room, so it's really good for larger groups (3-4 people)\n- Sometimes the order of puzzles wasn't entirely clear and solving in the wrong order could stall the game\n- Overall, very good experience, even though we haven't finished it on time.\n:::\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"leaflet html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-bb099591c0dc4ddf6d47\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-bb099591c0dc4ddf6d47\">{\"x\":{\"options\":{\"crs\":{\"crsClass\":\"L.CRS.EPSG3857\",\"code\":null,\"proj4def\":null,\"projectedBounds\":null,\"options\":{}}},\"calls\":[{\"method\":\"addTiles\",\"args\":[\"https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png\",null,null,{\"minZoom\":0,\"maxZoom\":18,\"tileSize\":256,\"subdomains\":\"abc\",\"errorTileUrl\":\"\",\"tms\":false,\"noWrap\":false,\"zoomOffset\":0,\"zoomReverse\":false,\"opacity\":1,\"zIndex\":1,\"detectRetina\":false,\"attribution\":\"&copy; <a href=\\\"https://openstreetmap.org/copyright/\\\">OpenStreetMap<\\/a>,  <a href=\\\"https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/\\\">ODbL<\\/a>\"}]},{\"method\":\"addProviderTiles\",\"args\":[\"Esri.WorldGrayCanvas\",null,null,{\"errorTileUrl\":\"\",\"noW